<title>UK: 3i CEO Macpherson to step down early.</title>
<headline>3i CEO Macpherson to step down early.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venture capital group 3i Plc said on Thursday its chief executive Ewen Macpherson had requested early retirement with effect from July and would be replaced by the company's current finance director, Brian Larcombe.</p>
</text>
